{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他暂时放下对两人未来的思虑，只想舒服地待在当下的亲近里，似乎心里有话却没有说出来。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、放松、陶醉、安静、隐约心动\",\n      \"missed\": \"第二段想告诉对方自己有多喜欢、想确认对方是否也有同样感受，却没找到开口时机、念头逐渐淡掉的具体过程，需要逐句读。右上角的心动却不敢说提示也比较小。\",\n      \"score\": 2\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他很享受两人的亲近，想表达喜欢、确认对方的心意，却又把话咽了回去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舒服、陶醉、心动、犹豫、克制、纠结\",\n      \"missed\": \"他究竟想问对方什么、为什么念头最后淡了，仍需要读第二段长句。下方短语中的受了牵绊、思绪难以拼凑、无法解开的结比较抽象，具体指向不够直接。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他沉浸在两人的亲近中，想说出自己的喜欢并探问对方心意，但话到了嘴边又退了回去。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"舒适、陶醉、心动、犹豫、欲言又止、难以释怀\",\n      \"missed\": \"想确认对方是不是也一样，以及念头刚出现就消退的细微心理变化，仍需细读。底部金色线条和圆点主要提供漂浮、流动的氛围，无法独立传达人物处境。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 3,\n  \"main_problem\": \"最影响扫读的是第二段核心心事被装进一个较长的句子里。后两张虽然增加了急着说一句、又沉回去、念头刚冒头等短语，让欲言又止更容易被抓到，但下方又连续堆叠多组相近或抽象的词，容易变成逐个扫词。整体两组文字与各自的感受基本能对应：第一组是享受亲近，第二组是想表达却说不出口；但底部抽象动画和右上角提示与这两组内容的联系不够直接。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b0a90b52-d1ad-4ccb-baa7-c913491df632", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T002932368159Z", "elapsed_seconds": 88.688, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T00:31:01.046642+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "ff8d7b553182aa867d0650849aa0b3b8767f5465497d49c1845d5e54bd98d39e", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T002932368159Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8147610a6a75ecb31b0f4b15496922b55daae7f9f4ccd81569488e71d5567b09"}}}
